WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.795
Threat hunting proactively searches for evidence of suspicious or malicious activity that may evade automated detection.

2
00:00:06.795 --> 00:00:14.697
Hunting complements monitoring by using hypotheses, telemetry, intelligence, and analyst judgment to explore uncertainty.

3
00:00:14.697 --> 00:00:24.515
Valuable outcomes include improved visibility, stronger detections, better baselines, identified coverage gaps, and informed incident handoffs.

4
00:00:24.515 --> 00:00:34.283
Mature programs combine governance, skilled analysts, quality data, repeatable methods, collaboration, measurement, and continuous learning.
